Origin of this work
-------------------

Tegami Mail is a modified version of Hylki, a GNOME email client:

    Hylki 1.46.0
    https://github.com/hyprlab/hylki
    upstream commit c82906d7878eabcef0013b69c357d0bd9695720f
    Copyright (C) 2026 Hyprlab and the Hylki contributors
    Licensed under AGPL-3.0-or-later

Tegami Mail was started from that commit on 2026-10-31. The unmodified import
is the Git commit "Import Hylki 1.46.0 (AGPL-3.0-or-later) as the starting
point"; every later commit in this repository is a change made by the Tegami
Mail authors, with its date, and is the record of what was modified.

